2.53.0

Provide helpers that allow architectures implement
illegitimate PTE direct accesses while the lazy MMU
mode is enabled, such as:

	pte_t pte = *ptep;
	*ptep = pte;

By contrast, these would have to be:

	pte_t pte = ptep_get(ptep);
